{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0703_1000_044miz", "source_sha256": "197af935b3939c959e476ecd680d11255944228991dd4a35f8e6a6a8656628b8", "ja": "わっ。{$P$}。", "zh": "哇。{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0703_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1dede497b4a888e9bcb38760a57847cd62a2b2e7277955284063a7bd2c472a61", "ja": "ん？　おお、瑞希か。\nお疲れ様、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "嗯？哦，是瑞希啊。\n辛苦了，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0703_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "5cf0e0d6852070cb6e8314ca3946f86143e78f49f09512e5b4b7d47007608053", "ja": "いつも通りのリアクション。\nやっぱり私には、向いてないのかも。……しゅん。", "zh": "和平常一样的反应。\n果然我可能不适合。……沮丧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0703_1003_p", "source_sha256": "495e2b68a2377547740ffe397d47e4ac63756858d190a9b351f44673a14bcbfe", "ja": "えっ？　な、何か変なことしちゃったか？", "zh": "咦？难、难道我做了什么奇怪的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0703_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "4553b6bb9991d1eeb74c6ac3072c7ae54f86cf2f0ddc8e36fef142f5d177330b", "ja": "いえ、{$P$}の反応は正しいです。\n正しいからこそ……落ち込んでいるのです。", "zh": "不，{$P$}的反应很正常。\n正因为正常……我才感到失落。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0703_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "25d164b292155dadefc54543b69a208459a41ae182ea7188d4a3c53e05c43a21", "ja": "このままでは、みんなを恐怖のどん底に引きずり込む\n立派なお化けを演じられないのではと。", "zh": "这样下去，我怕自己没法演好一个把大家拖入恐怖深渊的出色鬼怪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0703_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c56266cd18a08068a9af25438b675bb1cf744a865a905360c5e8dba5f83f26db", "ja": "お化け役……今度の肝試し番組の話だな。\nひょっとして、今のは驚かせる練習を？", "zh": "幽灵角色……你说的是下次那个试胆节目吧。  \n难道刚才是在练习吓人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0703_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "16a23f12cc89904a4c02b349275220881235dfdc063e753659109da4b8dacbe2", "ja": "はい。立派なお化けになるべく、廊下を通る人\nひとりひとりを驚かしていたのですが……。", "zh": "是的。为了成为一名出色的鬼，我一直在吓唬每一个经过走廊的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0703_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "a46845e8b5e84371b2bab87531d9b638c8bb88ce058f1af42d31e9b80da8ac0c", "ja": "誰も怖がってはくれませんでした。\nそして、{$P$}も……。", "zh": "没有一个人害怕。然后，{$P$}也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0703_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a6a5f96aaecb65b0be0c7a4e3d5d335acd67724661997685fdc2cdd943f8b3c7", "ja": "なるほど……。もしかしたら、あの怖がらせ方が\n瑞希に合ってないのかもしれないな。", "zh": "原来如此……说不定，那种吓人的方式\n不适合瑞希吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0703_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "48aaedcbee5b2acbc1517ad94e6e868d1380eee6c754fd271bf3c986a019be78", "ja": "私と方法が噛み合っていない……確かに。\nでは私に合う怖がらせ方とは、どんなものでしょうか？", "zh": "我和这种方法合不来……确实如此。\n那么，适合我的吓人方式会是什么样的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0703_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c3bad2b3bf15b7c4e324d090aa23253a497c08879607338fd31e2896e73f46da", "ja": "そうだな……。瑞希はポーカーフェイスが得意だから、\n暗闇の中、無表情で佇んでみるとか……どうだろう？", "zh": "是啊……瑞希很擅长扑克脸，所以要不要试试在黑暗中面无表情地站着……怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0703_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "10e503973be81f8772b980cb8eaf8e2d4c8a0ffef165df0ee7dde09217c1475d", "ja": "おお。不気味な怖さを表現するんですね。\nそれなら、私にもできそうです。では……。", "zh": "哦哦。是要表现出那种诡异的恐怖感吧。\n这样的话，我好像也能做到。那就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0703_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "cbf7a17f93025dfb0734d459eb4dc29ed68bbbb0e73fb2805ce5812b7f69ccb6", "ja": "じっ…………。", "zh": "盯…………。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0703_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "2c0a14c4dee7358fb8f50f67a06bbe0bf06edbc8edf55ef416055500e6928c1f", "ja": "…………っ。", "zh": "…………唔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0703_1015_p", "source_sha256": "807a7af65ed7059b2b1209e2c1b6bac0c582c186e5daceaead3bff06ce9ca591", "ja": "どうしたんだ？　途中までいい感じだったのに……。", "zh": "怎么了？明明刚才还挺顺利的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0703_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "d95e4d2a414e249fb26061a321b7f987118a4206793e2b881f735aee990410fb", "ja": "すみません。なんだか急にドキドキしてきて。\n……お化けの道は、やはり険しいですね。", "zh": "对不起。不知怎么的，突然心跳加速起来了。\n……看来，成为幽灵的道路果然很艰难呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0703_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "97ee5a21ecf75721931d842d0c56e374c205a7cb991cd60446f0106fade77f1d", "ja": "ですが、いいヒントをいただきました。本番まで\nしっかり練習しておきます。……やるぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "不过，我得到了很好的提示。正式演出前我会好好练习。……加油，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
